cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AdityaNet or reference its results, please cite it as below."
title: "AdityaNet: A Verifiable Research Platform over the Aditya-L1 Solar X-Ray Archive"
abstract: >-
  A static research platform over a frozen, digest-addressed dataset derived from the
  Aditya-L1 SoLEXS and HEL1OS X-ray instruments. Every rendered figure resolves to a
  committed artifact and is re-verified against source in CI. The platform publishes a
  reproducible negative result: on the evaluated M/X-class flare detection tasks, machine
  learning provides no operational benefit over a single threshold on the SoLEXS count
  rate, and a spectral-resolution ablation is a confirmed null.
type: software
